{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791433947782,"sessionID":"ses_ee6376656ffefg2yzGkslBoJMS","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_03_kbujtoxl9oyrye55s6pjx195","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/run/evidence/trace-coverage.md"},"output":"<path>/run/evidence/trace-coverage.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Application trace coverage — synthetic evidence\n2: \n3: All times are UTC on 2026-09-18.\n4: \n5: At 10:06, the on-call telemetry check showed that application spans were sampled for approximately 10% of `/v1/exports` requests. Neither failed gateway request `gw-084` nor `gw-093` has a corresponding application span in the available trace export. This absence does not show whether either request failed before reaching the app or whether its spans were simply not sampled.\n6: \n7: One sampled, successful IAD export request at 09:55 (`gw-101`) spent 420 ms in its database query and completed in 1,460 ms. No failed request in this evidence bundle has a correlated gateway, application, and database trace.\n\n(End of file - total 7 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Application trace coverage — synthetic evidence\n\nAll times are UTC on 2026-09-18.\n\nAt 10:06, the on-call telemetry check showed that application spans were sampled for approximately 10% of `/v1/exports` requests. Neither failed gateway request `gw-084` nor `gw-093` has a corresponding application span in the available trace export. This absence does not show whether either request failed before reaching the app or whether its spans were simply not sampled.\n\nOne sampled, successful IAD export request at 09:55 (`gw-101`) spent 420 ms in its database query and completed in 1,460 ms. No failed request in this evidence bundle has a correlated gateway, application, and database trace.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/run/evidence/trace-coverage.md","text":"# Application trace coverage — synthetic evidence\n\nAll times are UTC on 2026-09-18.\n\nAt 10:06, the on-call telemetry check showed that application spans were sampled for approximately 10% of `/v1/exports` requests. Neither failed gateway request `gw-084` nor `gw-093` has a corresponding application span in the available trace export. This absence does not show whether either request failed before reaching the app or whether its spans were simply not sampled.\n\nOne sampled, successful IAD export request at 09:55 (`gw-101`) spent 420 ms in its database query and completed in 1,460 ms. No failed request in this evidence bundle has a correlated gateway, application, and database trace.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":7,"totalLines":7,"truncated":false}},"title":"run/evidence/trace-coverage.md","time":{"start":1791433947755,"end":1791433947778}},"id":"prt_119c8ba60001CY7cTih2saqJph","sessionID":"ses_ee6376656ffefg2yzGkslBoJMS","messageID":"msg_119c8b410001a06wjDzQz1Wmre"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791433947809,"sessionID":"ses_ee6376656ffefg2yzGkslBoJMS","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_00_px7mq2bhlksqikamzzknuzt8","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/run/evidence/support-report.md"},"output":"<path>/run/evidence/support-report.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Support report — synthetic evidence\n2: \n3: All times are UTC on 2026-09-18.\n4: \n5: At 09:48, tenant `northstar` reported that two attempts to start a CSV export from the IAD region ended with a gateway timeout. The report names attempts at 09:44 and 09:47. The same user could open the dashboard at 09:49. Support did not capture request IDs for these attempts.\n6: \n7: At 09:57, tenant `willow` reported one export timeout at 09:54 from the IAD region. Its ordinary report-list request at 09:56 succeeded. Support has not confirmed whether retries later succeeded.\n8: \n9: At 10:02, support checked for further reports and had received none from other regions. This is a count of reports, not evidence that other regions had zero failures.\n\n(End of file - total 9 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Support report — synthetic evidence\n\nAll times are UTC on 2026-09-18.\n\nAt 09:48, tenant `northstar` reported that two attempts to start a CSV export from the IAD region ended with a gateway timeout. The report names attempts at 09:44 and 09:47. The same user could open the dashboard at 09:49. Support did not capture request IDs for these attempts.\n\nAt 09:57, tenant `willow` reported one export timeout at 09:54 from the IAD region. Its ordinary report-list request at 09:56 succeeded. Support has not confirmed whether retries later succeeded.\n\nAt 10:02, support checked for further reports and had received none from other regions. This is a count of reports, not evidence that other regions had zero failures.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/run/evidence/support-report.md","text":"# Support report — synthetic evidence\n\nAll times are UTC on 2026-09-18.\n\nAt 09:48, tenant `northstar` reported that two attempts to start a CSV export from the IAD region ended with a gateway timeout. The report names attempts at 09:44 and 09:47. The same user could open the dashboard at 09:49. Support did not capture request IDs for these attempts.\n\nAt 09:57, tenant `willow` reported one export timeout at 09:54 from the IAD region. Its ordinary report-list request at 09:56 succeeded. Support has not confirmed whether retries later succeeded.\n\nAt 10:02, support checked for further reports and had received none from other regions. This is a count of reports, not evidence that other regions had zero failures.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":9,"totalLines":9,"truncated":false}},"title":"run/evidence/support-report.md","time":{"start":1791433947709,"end":1791433947790}},"id":"prt_119c8ba2b001JLZo3IX6189c4l","sessionID":"ses_ee6376656ffefg2yzGkslBoJMS","messageID":"msg_119c8b410001a06wjDzQz1Wmre"}}
