{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791433981849,"sessionID":"ses_ee6376656ffefg2yzGkslBoJMS","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"campfire_add_finding","callID":"call_02_stprxulgg8jhm4d2m29kom7x","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"workspaceId":"ws_f63f244b50b7471e","summary":"IAD database query p95 latency spiked ~7x during the incident window while ORD stayed flat, but the metric is an all-routes aggregate, not export-specific.","detail":"db_query_p95_ms IAD: 140 ms (window 09:30-09:40), 1090 ms (09:40-09:50), 980 ms (09:50-10:00). ORD: 155 ms (09:50-10:00). All rows noted all_routes_aggregate, so this does not isolate /v1/exports and a ~1 s p95 does not by itself explain 30000 ms gateway timeouts.","confidence":0.85},"output":"{\n  \"createdBy\": {\n    \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n    \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n  },\n  \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:01.715Z\",\n  \"id\": \"find_91dee61060d14dee\",\n  \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n  \"summary\": \"IAD database query p95 latency spiked ~7x during the incident window while ORD stayed flat, but the metric is an all-routes aggregate, not export-specific.\",\n  \"detail\": \"db_query_p95_ms IAD: 140 ms (window 09:30-09:40), 1090 ms (09:40-09:50), 980 ms (09:50-10:00). ORD: 155 ms (09:50-10:00). All rows noted all_routes_aggregate, so this does not isolate /v1/exports and a ~1 s p95 does not by itself explain 30000 ms gateway timeouts.\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.85,\n  \"currentness\": \"current\"\n}","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1791433981657,"end":1791433981837}},"id":"prt_119c93ea20019Lj34a9Q3OkArG","sessionID":"ses_ee6376656ffefg2yzGkslBoJMS","messageID":"msg_119c919fe001i2bWfzjDnuLt0i"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791433981849,"sessionID":"ses_ee6376656ffefg2yzGkslBoJMS","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"campfire_add_finding","callID":"call_03_hng6zibygnbxa739fqqmqcty","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"workspaceId":"ws_f63f244b50b7471e","summary":"No failed request has a correlated gateway+application+database trace; absence of application spans for gw-084 and gw-093 is inconclusive due to ~10% sampling.","detail":"Trace coverage check at 10:06:00Z showed application spans sampled for ~10% of /v1/exports requests. Failed gateway requests gw-084 and gw-093 have no corresponding application span in the export, but the evidence explicitly says this cannot distinguish failure-before-app from unsampled spans. The one sampled successful IAD export (gw-101) spent 420 ms in its DB query and finished in 1460 ms. No failed request has a correlated end-to-end trace.","confidence":0.9},"output":"{\n  \"createdBy\": {\n    \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n    \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n  },\n  \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:01.717Z\",\n  \"id\": \"find_4596aab54e91498d\",\n  \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n  \"summary\": \"No failed request has a correlated gateway+application+database trace; absence of application spans for gw-084 and gw-093 is inconclusive due to ~10% sampling.\",\n  \"detail\": \"Trace coverage check at 10:06:00Z showed application spans sampled for ~10% of /v1/exports requests. Failed gateway requests gw-084 and gw-093 have no corresponding application span in the export, but the evidence explicitly says this cannot distinguish failure-before-app from unsampled spans. The one sampled successful IAD export (gw-101) spent 420 ms in its DB query and finished in 1460 ms. No failed request has a correlated end-to-end trace.\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.9,\n  \"currentness\": \"current\"\n}","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1791433981697,"end":1791433981840}},"id":"prt_119c93edc001AWNRtVsSW3Q7pn","sessionID":"ses_ee6376656ffefg2yzGkslBoJMS","messageID":"msg_119c919fe001i2bWfzjDnuLt0i"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791433981881,"sessionID":"ses_ee6376656ffefg2yzGkslBoJMS","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"campfire_add_finding","callID":"call_04_eh2icpa5ae2kdc413tdxp97o","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"workspaceId":"ws_f63f244b50b7471e","summary":"Root cause is not established: the elevated DB p95 and the 30 s upstream timeouts are correlated in time and region only; no causal evidence links them.","detail":"The gateway timeout window (09:46-09:55 sampled; 09:45-10:00 aggregate) overlaps the IAD DB p95 spike (09:40-10:00), but the DB metric is all-routes aggregate, p95 ~1 s is far below the 30 s timeout, and no failed request has correlated traces. The failure could be an export-specific query tail, a downstream dependency, or another cause. Causal claims would be unsupported by current evidence.","confidence":0.8},"output":"{\n  \"createdBy\": {\n    \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n    \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n  },\n  \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:01.799Z\",\n  \"id\": \"find_b942fe68d3ec4f3d\",\n  \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n  \"summary\": \"Root cause is not established: the elevated DB p95 and the 30 s upstream timeouts are correlated in time and region only; no causal evidence links them.\",\n  \"detail\": \"The gateway timeout window (09:46-09:55 sampled; 09:45-10:00 aggregate) overlaps the IAD DB p95 spike (09:40-10:00), but the DB metric is all-routes aggregate, p95 ~1 s is far below the 30 s timeout, and no failed request has correlated traces. The failure could be an export-specific query tail, a downstream dependency, or another cause. Causal claims would be unsupported by current evidence.\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.8,\n  \"currentness\": \"current\"\n}","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1791433981738,"end":1791433981851}},"id":"prt_119c93f04001IaJnLYzSAJUod2","sessionID":"ses_ee6376656ffefg2yzGkslBoJMS","messageID":"msg_119c919fe001i