1090ms) is specific to /v1/exports or all routes. Completion condition: either a correlated failed trace identifying the slow/failing span, or an explicit statement that traces remain uncorrelated and the DB metric remains non-export-specific. Do NOT change production; any remediation needs incident-lead approval (see dec_f949414ac9e4444f).\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"assignee\": {\n    \"actorId\": \"agt_2cada74364b54b0d\",\n    \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n  },\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:19.862Z\"\n}","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1791433999818,"end":1791433999873}},"id":"prt_119c9856a0019ATMCnofuB0Fm6","sessionID":"ses_ee6376656ffefg2yzGkslBoJMS","messageID":"msg_119c966fa001C0Q4kKpL9TUWZh"}}
