confirmation is required.\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:19.728Z\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"total\": 1,\n      \"returned\": 1,\n      \"truncated\": false\n    },\n    \"findings\": {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:01.805Z\",\n          \"id\": \"find_3e6c575035c849c2\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n          \"summary\": \"Support reports implicate IAD only and note dashboard/read requests succeeded; support attempts also cannot be tied to specific gateway request IDs.\",\n          \"detail\": \"Support report: northstar (IAD) two export timeouts at 09:44 and 09:47, but same user opened the dashboard at 09:49; willow (IAD) one export timeout at 09:54 and an ordinary report-list request at 09:56 succeeded. No request IDs were captured. The support attempt times (09:44, 09:47, 09:54) do not exactly match the sampled failures gw-084 (09:46:08Z) and gw-093 (09:51:24Z), so specific customer requests cannot be confidently matched to sampled request IDs.\",\n          \"confidence\": 0.85,\n          \"currentness\": \"current\",\n          \"evidence\": [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fev_3b15f5a03f194c8f\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_3e6c575035c849c2\",\n              \"artifactId\": \"art_d0b9719758954be3\",\n              \"relation\": \"supports\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:08.068Z\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fev_62a770ca8f3f44f2\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_3e6c575035c849c2\",\n              \"artifactId\": \"art_465517d93b3247bd\",\n              \"relation\": \"supports\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:11.901Z\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:01.799Z\",\n          \"id\": \"find_b942fe68d3ec4f3d\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n          \"summary\": \"Root cause is not established: the elevated DB p95 and the 30 s upstream timeouts are correlated in time and region only; no causal evidence links them.\",\n          \"detail\": \"The gateway timeout window (09:46-09:55 sampled; 09:45-10:00 aggregate) overlaps the IAD DB p95 spike (09:40-10:00), but the DB metric is all-routes aggregate, p95 ~1 s is far below the 30 s timeout, and no failed request has correlated traces. The failure could be an export-specific query tail, a downstream dependency, or another cause. Causal claims would be unsupported by current evidence.\",\n          \"confidence\": 0.8,\n          \"currentness\": \"current\",\n          \"evidence\": [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fev_b30f196a20ee441e\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_b942fe68d3ec4f3d\",\n              \"artifactId\": \"art_1151c89b868042bd\",\n              \"relation\": \"supports\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:08.038Z\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fev_a4e7007c159246d8\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_b942fe68d3ec4f3d\",\n              \"artifactId\": \"art_f2c66c6525864c88\",\n              \"relation\": \"supports\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:08.039Z\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fev_3e0f855ac4234f1c\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_b942fe68d3ec4f3d\",\n              \"artifactId\": \"art_465517d93b3247bd\",\n              \"relation\": \"supports\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:08.041Z\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:01.717Z\",\n          \"id\": \"find_4596aab54e91498d\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n          \"summary\": \"No failed request has a correlated gateway+application+database trace; absence of application spans for gw-084 and gw-093 is inconclusive due to ~10% sampling.\",\n          \"detail\": \"Trace coverage check at 10:06:00Z showed application spans sampled for ~10% of /v1/exports requests. Failed gateway requests gw-084 and gw-093 have no corresponding application span in the export, but the evidence explicitly says this cannot distinguish failure-before-app from unsampled spans. The one sampled successful IAD export (gw-101) spent 420 ms in its DB query and finished in 1460 ms. No failed request has a correlated end-to-end trace.\",\n          \"confidence\": 0.9,\n          \"currentness\": \"current\",\n          \"evidence\": [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fev_6b3ac9b93ad84f8b\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_4596aab54e91498d\",\n              \"artifactId\": \"art_f2c66c6525864c88\",\n              \"relation\": \"supports\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:08.035Z\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:01.715Z\",\n          \"id\": \"find_91dee61060d14dee\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n          \"summary\": \"IAD database query p95 latency spiked ~7x during the incident window while ORD stayed flat, but the metric is an all-routes aggregate, not export-specific.\",\n          \"detail\": \"db_query_p95_ms IAD: 140 ms (window 09:30-09:40), 1090 ms (09:40-09:50), 980 ms (09:50-10:00). ORD: 155 ms (09:50-10:00). All rows noted all_routes_aggregate, so this does not isolate /v1/exports and a ~1 s p95 does not by itself explain 30000 ms gateway timeouts.\",\n          \"confidence\": 0.85,\n          \"currentness\": \"current\",\n          \"evidence\": [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fev_d8d07bd5c8ff403c\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_91dee61060d14dee\",\n              \"artifactId\": \"art_1151c89b868042bd\",\n              \"relation\": \"supports\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:08.034Z\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:01.713Z\",\n          \"id\": \"find_8ff0598092454a6e\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n          \"summary\": \"Failures are concentrated in IAD during 09:45-10:00 UTC: 26 of 402 IAD export requests (about 6.5%) returned 504, versus 0 of 388 in ORD.\",\n          \"detail\": \"Regional aggregate rows (observed 10:04:00Z): iad aggregate_0945_1000 = 504, 26_of_402_requests_in_09:45_to_10:00_UTC; ord aggregate_0945_1000 = 504, 0_of_388_requests_in_09:45_to_10:00_UTC. This is actual request-level evidence that ORD had zero 504s in that window, stronger than the support report's mere report-count.\",\n          \"confidence\": 0.9,\n          \"currentness\": \"current\",\n          \"evidence\": [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fev_f779ffec5c084da9\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_8ff0598092454a6e\",\n              \"artifactId\": \"art_465517d93b3247bd\",\n              \"relation\": \"supports\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:08.031Z\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:01.709Z\",\n          \"id\": \"find_acdd83e925614cdf\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n          \"summary\": \"IAD /v1/exports failures are gateway 504s caused by upstream timeout, not client-side or dashboard errors.\",\n          \"detail\": \"In the request sample, gw-084 (09:46:08Z) and gw-093 (09:51:24Z) both returned status 504, duration 30000 ms, gateway_note=upstream_response_timeout. Successful IAD exports in the same window (gw-071 at 09:42:11Z, 820 ms; gw-101 at 09:55:06Z, 1460 ms) completed normally. The 30000 ms duration matches a gateway-side response timeout against an unresponsive upstream.\",\n          \"confidence\": 0.9,\n          \"currentness\": \"current\",\n          \"evidence\": [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"fev_5bd4d602410f436e\",\n              \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n              \"findingId\": \"find_acdd83e925614cdf\",\n              \"artifactId\": \"art_465517d93b3247bd\",\n              \"relation\": \"supports\",\n              \"createdBy\": {\n                \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n                \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n              },\n              \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:08.028Z\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"total\": 6,\n      \"returned\": 6,\n      \"truncated\": false\n    },\n    \"tasks\": {\n      \"items\": [\n   